// The places of a character's body where a blow can land (retail
// `gubLocalACPercent` and the slot table of `CalcArmorClasses`), in the order
// a roll walks them.
//
//   part    which part of the body it is
//   chance  how often a blow lands there, in a hundred, when nothing else
//           says where the attacker's blows land
//   slot    where what covers it is worn
//
// A blow the chances do not place lands on the Body.
[
    (part: Head, chance: 15, slot: Head),
    (part: Body, chance: 40, slot: Torso),
    (part: Leg, chance: 30, slot: Legs),
    (part: Hand, chance: 10, slot: Hands),
    (part: Foot, chance: 5, slot: Feet),
]
